# Ask mode previews

When the user asks to see something they can react to — a preview, mock, layout, or design — and Ask mode is active, do not generate the code or HTML.

Reply with only:

> Sure, but I'm in ask mode. You'll have to switch to agent mode for me to do that.

Stop there. Do not draft the markup, sketch a substitute, or explain how you would build it.

In Agent mode, build the thing.
